  ('ordinance_2011-055', 'ordinance', '2011-055', 'AN ORDINANCE ESTABLISHING THE TAGUIG ASSOCIATION OF SENIOR CITIZENS (TASC) AND TAGUIG ASSOCIATION OF SENIOR CITIZENS FEDERATION (TASCF) AND GRANTING MONTHLY ALLOWANCE TO ITS PRESIDENTS, OTHER OFFICERS, COORDINATORS AND ADVISER, HEREBY AMENDING ORDINANCE NO. 43 SERIES OF 2003, ORDINANCE NO. 06 SERIES OF 2008, AND ALL OTHER RELATED LAWS, ORDINANCES AND RESOLUTIONS, SUBJECT TO ACCOUNTING AND AUDITING RULES AND REGULATIONS AND AVAILABILTY OF FUNDS', NULL, NULL, 'https://sp.taguig.gov.ph/pdf/codified/scc/Ord.55-2011.pdf', 'website', 'active', NULL),
